<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:51:16Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>「究竟是誰在批准什麼？」：光州雙年展台灣改名風波背後的角力</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c2kwv977qlko/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T14:33:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c2kwv977qlko/trad--f5a9fa958415.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c2kwv977qlko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">8月初，韓國舉行的光州雙年展因主辦單位改動「台灣館」名稱陷入爭議。事件曝光後，台灣參展藝術家提出抗議，當地許多藝術家、民眾也進行聲援。主辦單位最終同意恢復使用「台灣館」，但引起中方不滿。</summary></entry><entry><title>親俄宣傳網絡內幕：利用烏克蘭女性遭強姦的假消息作引流「誘餌」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v19vx721o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T01:39:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v19vx721o/trad--d5c991f3efef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v19vx721o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">俄羅斯 Telegram 頻道利用虛假的強姦消息和烏克蘭女性的照片，引誘數百萬用戶加入親戰宣傳網。</summary></entry><entry><title>不同版本的世界地圖有哪些正確及錯誤之處？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:51:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T04:35:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad--ab1df95ad712.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crm9k8pggjvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">聯合國決計採用新的世界地圖來反映非洲的真實面積。但讓我們仔細看看不同版本的世界地圖有哪些正確和錯誤之處。</summary></entry><entry><title>福島爭議升溫：阿根廷制裁附近油企，特朗普暗示未必協助英國</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c89jgd5gn14o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T07:41:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c89jgd5gn14o/trad--4ea134aed1fb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c89jgd5gn14o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統特朗普說，英國「在我們與伊朗開戰時沒有出手幫忙」。他此前表示，若英國未能增加防務開支，美國可能會修改在福克蘭群島主權問題上的中立立場。</summary></entry><entry><title>機器人開始索要小費，但錢到底進了誰的口袋？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn5dx6gqxn9o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:51:16Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T02:02:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn5dx6gqxn9o/trad--97a95326a9aa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn5dx6gqxn9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自疫情以來，人們被索要小費的場合比以往任何時候都多，而且往往是由數字支付系統主動提示的。消費者抱怨這是一種「情感勒索」，而建議小費的百分比還在不斷攀升。儘管有些人嘲笑美國人「失控」的小費文化，但它正蔓延全球。</summary></entry><entry><title>尼泊爾—西藏泥石流：堰塞湖和冰湖是下一個「定時炸彈」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T00:01:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad--418da5ad44fa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zpzwwxlzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">事發河谷上游已形成兩個堰塞湖。與此同時，原本散佈在喜馬拉雅山區的冰川湖，在災區內有10座被標記為高風險，專家形容它們是「定時炸彈」。</summary></entry><entry><title>泥石流摧毀西藏吉隆口岸的關鍵幾分鐘</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T12:01:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad--6512b63ed4b6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp802gnj5kmo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">吉隆口岸位處西藏與尼泊爾的重要貿易通路之上，中國與尼泊爾兩側各有數以百計外國旅客在泥石流衝擊後下落不明。</summary></entry><entry><title>數百名水力發電工人受困隧道：尼泊爾地下夢魘</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crer81r33pno/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T04:44:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crer81r33pno/trad--633263beece9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crer81r33pno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">數百名工人的家屬仍抱持希望，相信受困於尼泊爾特里蘇里河（Trishuli River）沿岸龐大、充滿泥漿的隧道網絡中的親人仍有機會被活著找到。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國審查西藏口岸遭洪災衝擊畫面，當地災民情況我們所知甚少</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-30T12:37:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad--5ba777fb8c53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cnvl38dyyq0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些關於這場致命山洪暴發最驚人的畫面，中國官方媒體未對公眾播放。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國航母「林肯號」航行250天終抵泰國，這是我們目前知道的情況</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzg4en4k3o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T06:01:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzg4en4k3o/trad--9b13091d9bda.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzg4en4k3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國核動力航空母艦「亞伯拉罕·林肯號」（USS Abraham Lincoln）在海上連續航行250天，現在終於抵達泰國靠岸，近5,000名船員得以休息。</summary></entry><entry><title>豬腎在人體內運作271天——這會是器官移植的未來嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1dlr007vkgo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T05:57:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1dlr007vkgo/trad--21f8b5056ce3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c1dlr007vkgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一名男子在等待人體腎臟移植期間，依靠移植的豬腎存活了創紀錄的九個月。</summary></entry><entry><title>行走在紐約：我發現監控攝像頭數量遠超想像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyznp4qlg9o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T06:25:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyznp4qlg9o/trad--f8ee58d5303d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyznp4qlg9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在私隱與安全之間作出取捨時，了解你所在社區的監控基礎設施到底有多普遍或會有所幫助。要查清楚這一點已有一些簡單的方法。</summary></entry><entry><title>加拿大新鈔首印查爾斯國王肖像，為英國以外首例</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyk1degv1ro/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T08:09:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyk1degv1ro/trad--11fe1f0a1a7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyk1degv1ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這張豎版紙幣上印有查爾斯三世國王的肖像，他是70多年來第一位出現在加拿大紙幣上的新君主。</summary></entry><entry><title>《肖申克的救贖》中國公映：官方字幕翻譯何以引發爭議？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd4361y6no/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T00:24:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd4361y6no/trad--96ebef9f3bbd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yd4361y6no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">例如，同性戀（homosexual）譯成「不同的人」，queer 譯成「變態」，「make love under tree」（直譯應為「在樹下做愛」）譯成「許下終身」。</summary></entry><entry><title>聯合國警告可能出現「超大型」厄爾尼諾現象，各國須準備應對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm27n2emn1zo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T12:09:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm27n2emn1zo/trad--00f7bc2e196e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm27n2emn1zo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">聯合國世界氣象組織（WMO）警告，這種自然天氣現象可能為全球經濟帶來衝擊。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國公司獲批委內瑞拉油田百年開採權 分析人士迷惑 國民震怒</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4rkd5zepo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T08:59:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4rkd5zepo/trad--82c13ac29fb1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4rkd5zepo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">委內瑞拉近期沒有舉行選舉，或者說，沒有任何明確的選舉計劃，這在許多反對者看來是一種背叛。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒「勾結外國勢力危害國家安全」案認罪，最高可囚終身</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cly7r8yrxe5o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:11:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cly7r8yrxe5o/trad--7c6a9f67bcc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cly7r8yrxe5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">現年29歲的民主派活動人士黃之鋒，在法庭上承認一項中國《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力危害國家安全」罪，判刑押後至另日進行。至今，黃之鋒已失去自由逾2,100天。</summary></entry><entry><title>韓國光州雙年展: 中國退展，「台灣館」風波透露什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zd7j8nn0o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:56:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zd7j8nn0o/trad--3c74b05b6dc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cz6zd7j8nn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">韓國舉行的光州雙年展因「台灣館」名稱遭改動陷入爭議，中國週四（9月3日）宣布退出展覽。</summary></entry><entry><title>前線報導：BBC深入尼泊爾隧道和被洪水吞沒的小鎮</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy4z8w39j3no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T10:25:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy4z8w39j3no/trad--de1fa82ba0ca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cy4z8w39j3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在貝特拉瓦蒂地區，一些居民返回面目全非的家園，他們還要面臨的一大挑戰是如何處理逝者的遺體。與此同時，救援人員仍未放棄尋找倖存者，他們相信仍有人受困於特里蘇里河沿岸的隧道內。</summary></entry><entry><title>重獲自由未有期 回顧黃之鋒的公共生涯</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T13:55:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad--7214d6bbc403.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwyzd1jp8gqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控違反《香港國安法》下的「串謀勾結外國勢力」罪，2026年9月2日在高等法院出庭並認罪，法官將案件押後判刑。</summary></entry><entry><title>「大家都是做做樣子」：香港高中公民科推行五週年</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c93vq6245q2o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T08:18:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c93vq6245q2o/trad--65341b5f1096.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c93vq6245q2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港高中以「公民與社會發展科」取代通識科至今已五年，學生前往中國大陸考察亦由過去的自願參與，逐步成為課程安排的一部分。2025/26學年，約有5萬名高中學生參與相關考察，政府資助逾8,400萬港元。BBC中文採訪老師及學生，了解他們在考察期間的所見所聞，以及對這類活動的看法。</summary></entry><entry><title>前線報導：BBC走訪中尼邊境被洪災抹去的小鎮</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgmryk7xky8o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T05:45:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgmryk7xky8o/trad--9696aad17a81.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgmryk7xky8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC記者阿扎德·莫希里來到夏布盧貝西，這裡緊鄰中國西藏吉隆，曾經生活在這裡的社區已幾乎不留任何痕跡，取而代之的是大量乾硬的泥土和瓦礫。</summary></entry><entry><title>霍爾木茲海峽動盪，如何在巴拿馬運河引發中美角力？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-21T13:39:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad--77ccfd7692d6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cdj013krm3no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國再次就巴拿馬運河問題交鋒。這條戰略水道約佔全球海運貿易量5%，而美國近40%的集裝箱運輸都經過這裏。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國稱數十國助中國避特朗普關稅</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-14T05:11:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad--ca9553d15fcf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq6d1y1212po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國一份新報告稱，中國透過關稅較低的國家轉運貨物，以規避較高關稅。</summary></entry><entry><title>特習會後美中再現摩擦　「建設性穩定」能否撐到九月？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-04T00:01:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad--6863f100f319.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx7z51qvpgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">關稅、台灣、安全議題再起摩擦，特習會後的美中「建設性穩定」還能持續多久？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄的太空攻防戰：衛星如何成為現代戰爭的第一擊？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-01T09:56:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad--77d395c5dbdc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cgljn380r59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在現代戰爭中，環繞地球運行的人造衛星幾乎未曾受到波及；但到了21世紀，太空或許已不再是安全的避風港。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普政府禁止中國人形機械人進口 北京批「泛化國家安全」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-07-29T11:14:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad--e9e1ec045b93.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3ekn91y5j5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國和中國正陷入一場爭奪全球機械人與人工智能領導地位的競賽。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃之鋒：從學運領袖到國安法囚犯，重獲自由未有期</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T14:11:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad--afefb304de53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj4j8n42r51o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">自2020年11月被關押以來，香港民主派活動人士黃之鋒被控多宗罪名，至今已身在獄中接近六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>莫迪敦促普京結束烏克蘭戰爭，他能勸得動嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4r8e52nyo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-03T00:24:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4r8e52nyo/trad--7e22ef2d4a83.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5y4r8e52nyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印度經濟高度依賴自俄羅斯進口的折扣石油。自2022年普京發動對烏克蘭的全面入侵以來，莫迪已多次向普京提出過類似的呼籲。</summary></entry><entry><title>上合組織25週年：中國舞台、伊朗考驗，還是「清談場所」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8d39n7m2g8o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T14:11:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8d39n7m2g8o/trad--b2ba4faa3694.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c8d39n7m2g8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「整套東西說穿了，就是共識旗幟下的中國工具箱。成員加入自己感興趣的部分，沒有人被要求成為盟友。北京不要求同盟式義務，它要的是背書、參與，以及不要阻擋（中國）。」</summary></entry><entry><title>塔吉克斯坦年輕人之間緣何興起「漢語熱」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T09:41:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad--2ac81966f858.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5yj5eg69jjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">直到幾年前，英語仍被塔吉克年輕人視為最重要的外語，但隨著中國在中亞地區的經濟影響力不斷擴大，漢語成為了對年輕一代更具吸引力的選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>她放下演藝事業，回愛丁堡拯救家裏的中餐館</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T00:15:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad--d26df99023e1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czjzdlvly70o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">母親經營了30年的餐廳正在走下坡。因此，賀灕灑暫停了自己的演藝事業，回到蘇格蘭的家裏試一把。</summary></entry><entry><title>日本企業大舉押注印度　中國風險加深之際尋求新成長</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czxzkex7nd1o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-02T00:01:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czxzkex7nd1o/trad--97325c610e69.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/czxzkex7nd1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日本企業正加碼布局印度，因國內市場萎縮及中國風險升高。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國科技公司新嘗試：「性愛」機器人，瞄準「陪伴經濟」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T08:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad--7169231e3977.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9v9pkd7ejpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年來，中國的「陪伴經濟」異軍突起，AI和機器人技術的高速發展亦給這個市場注入諸多新的可能。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國總理赴泥石流災場前線意味著什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T11:41:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad--92b9a4244bc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c980env4n78o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國，災難應對往往也帶有政治訊號。尤其是中共中央總書記作出「重要指示」，或總理、副總理親赴現場，通常意味著北京把事件視為需要高度關注和統籌應對的重大危機。</summary></entry><entry><title>「在我眼中它就是黃金」：一張卡如何從遊戲工具變資產？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T04:32:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad--34e32e54f479.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0j3w0wxj18o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">市場分析公司統計，全球集換式卡牌（TCG）市場規模到2031年有望升至128.6億美元。原本屬於小朋友的遊戲工具，何以突然變成「紙上黃金」？</summary></entry><entry><title>「甲醛白菜」再現中國：食品安全監管的盲區在哪裡？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-26T11:07:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad--4f747496d312.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ce3rz7xxr04o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近日，中國河北省被揭發收購商為達到保鮮效果，將大白菜蘸取工業甲醛，再裝車運輸到外地，事件引發官方及輿論高度關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>執迷於「睡眠分數」如何反讓你睡得更差？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3wj1gd3x9no/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T02:05:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3wj1gd3x9no/trad--cb717d4dcba9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3wj1gd3x9no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">不少人會配戴追蹤器，檢測自己的睡眠分數，並用盡方法「睡眠極大化」（sleepmaxxing）。但專家指出，把睡眠遊戲化，正導致更多人出現睡眠失調問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我面試完就被捲走了積蓄」——Z世代求職者成為詐騙目標</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2z87ekee1o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T05:25:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2z87ekee1o/trad--bf01e3c99067.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx2z87ekee1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">求職者、尤其是 Z 世代，正成為虛假、帶有陷阱的招聘應用程式的目標。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國NASA全新超強望遠鏡將改寫我們對宇宙的理解</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-31T13:34:48Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad--d1936a91f9c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlwd2w1vnlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅曼太空望遠鏡（Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope）8月30日從佛羅里達州肯尼迪太空中心發射升空。</summary></entry><entry><title>星巴克咖啡就算了吧——Z世代喜歡喝冰飲</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c15897j72vno/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-09-01T01:19:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c15897j72vno/trad--ff3dacc6043a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c15897j72vno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">年輕消費者偏好冷飲和客製化飲品，到星巴克買熱咖啡不是他們的第一選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>這些藥物讓人更難以應對高溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-06T04:50:13Z</updated><published>2026-08-27T00:02:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad--0630c93feef5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg49yzyv4yko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些最常獲處方的藥物，包括用於治療抑鬱症、注意力不足過動症（ADHD）和高血壓的藥物，可能會增加脫水及其他與高溫相關疾病的風險。</summary></entry></feed>
